## InlinePasskeySyncSetup
## Shown after a desktop Firefox sign-in to sync with a password, when the account has no passkey.

inline-passkey-sync-setup-success-banner = You’re signed in to { -brand-firefox }
# Whether the passkey can unlock synced data is only known after it is created.
inline-passkey-sync-setup-description-v2 = Next time, use your fingerprint, face or device PIN to authenticate. If your device supports it, your passkey can also unlock your synced data.
